WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.207
Welcome to Reviyo.

00:00:01.277 --> 00:00:03.088
Here is how to help a business owner get

00:00:03.146 --> 00:00:03.738
started.

00:00:04.551 --> 00:00:07.546
First, open your developer invitation and create your partner

00:00:07.593 --> 00:00:08.197
password.

00:00:08.348 --> 00:00:10.298
This protects your private dashboard.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.992
Choose Create a business.

00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:15.836
Enter the owner's own email address, the business name,

00:00:15.871 --> 00:00:16.823
and its category.

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:19.505
Check the email carefully, because the owner will receive

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:20.352
the invitation.

00:00:21.049 --> 00:00:23.046
Next, prepare the review page.

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:26.726
Add the Google review link, business logo, and useful

00:00:26.819 --> 00:00:27.736
review topics.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.220
Test the Google link before you continue.

00:00:30.546 --> 00:00:33.123
Save the setup for later, or choose Save and

00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:33.959
invite owner.

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:36.722
You can edit a saved setup and resend the

00:00:36.757 --> 00:00:37.512
invitation.

00:00:38.464 --> 00:00:41.540
The owner opens their email, reviews the details, and

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.201
accepts the terms themselves.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.651
They then choose a plan and pay securely through

00:00:45.709 --> 00:00:46.394
Razorpay.

00:00:46.835 --> 00:00:49.459
Partner-created businesses do not have a free trial.

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:52.524
Once payment is confirmed, the owner can download their

00:00:52.582 --> 00:00:54.544
QR code and use their dashboard.

00:00:55.148 --> 00:00:58.387
If confirmation is delayed, choose Check payment status.

00:00:58.828 --> 00:00:59.827
Do not pay again.

00:01:00.268 --> 00:01:03.681
Customers scan the QR code, describe their real experience,

00:01:04.006 --> 00:01:05.190
and edit the draft.

00:01:06.003 --> 00:01:08.476
Each customer posts their own review on Google.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:11.471
Finally, add your payout bank account in your partner

00:01:11.518 --> 00:01:12.191
dashboard.

00:01:13.143 --> 00:01:16.197
A qualifying annual payment earns one thousand rupees after

00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:17.694
the fourteen-day payment check.

00:01:18.646 --> 00:01:22.071
Every ten qualifying owners earns a two-thousand-rupee bonus.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:24.870
Monthly and six-month plans do not earn commission.

00:01:25.682 --> 00:01:26.890
You prepare the setup.

00:01:27.493 --> 00:01:29.514
The owner stays in control of their account and

00:01:29.548 --> 00:01:30.280
payment.
